    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Angel Katusya once attended a class from an airport lounge at 1 am. She was in transit, but she wasn't going to miss the session. That's the kind of flexibility the Graduate School of Media and Communications' (GSMC) MA in Strategic Communication offers, and it's exactly what working professionals need.",
